    <briefdescription>
<para>Runs a battery of <ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_i_health_check" kindref="compound">IHealthCheck</ref> instances before an update begins. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All registered checks are executed sequentially. The overall result reports whether every check passed and includes the total wall-clock duration so callers can verify the ≤ 2 s budget.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_preflight_health_checker_1a08f4f6d50b19ac83c638445ff8343764" kindref="member">PreflightHealthChecker</ref><sp/>checker;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">checker.addCheck(std::make_unique&lt;DiskSpaceChecker&gt;(download_dir,<sp/>2<sp/>*<sp/>bundle_size));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">checker.addCheck(std::make_unique&lt;MemoryHeadroomChecker&gt;(256<sp/>*<sp/>1024<sp/>*<sp/>1024));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>checker.runAll();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!result.all_passed)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="batch5__safety__helpers_8h_1ad4a9117ce894e3319e903142347a0f63" kindref="member">LOG_ERROR</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Pre-flight<sp/>check<sp/>failed:<sp/>{}&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>result.error_summary);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">engine.applyHotReload(version);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
